# Flow Index Template

Purpose:
  Navigable tree of CASE depends-on and related relationships.
  Outputs to .specdd/flow-index.md at project level for /sdd-next consumption.

Owns: templates\specdd\flow-index.template.sdd

## Structure

Root: .specdd/flow-index.md

## CASE Tree Format

Flow_Index:
  {CASE_ID_01} ({CASE_NAME_01})
    ├── depends-on: {DEPENDS_ON_ID_01} [{✅|🔄|⏳}]
    ├── depends-on: {DEPENDS_ON_ID_02} [{✅|🔄|⏳}]
    └── related: {RELATED_ID_01} [{✅|🔄|⏳}]

  {CASE_ID_02} ({CASE_NAME_02})
    └── depends-on: {DEPENDS_ON_ID_03} [{✅|🔄|⏳}]

## Status Legend

Status:
  ✅ Closed / verified
  🔄 In progress / open
  ⏳ Planned / pending

## Usage

Used_By: /sdd-next command
Output: .specdd/flow-index.md
Refresh: On CASE status change or new CASE creation

State: +
